msgid "Each chapter has a goal and a number of moves. At first it's points; from her third chapter it's something of hers to do on the board, and in her last both. Reach it before your moves run out and the story carries on. There's no timer: take as long as you like."
msgstr "Setiap bab punya target dan jumlah langkah. Awalnya poin; mulai bab ketiganya, ada sesuatu yang harus dilakukan untuknya di papan, dan di bab terakhir keduanya. Capai sebelum langkahmu habis dan ceritanya berlanjut. Tidak ada batas waktu: santai saja."

msgid "Each kind of gem shows a number, so you don't need colour to tell them apart."
msgstr "Setiap jenis permata menampilkan nomor, jadi kamu tidak perlu warna untuk membedakannya."

msgid "Easy"
